{"conversation_hash": "6aee7cf75fbf9ddc8b1719ca5a3149ac", "model": "gpt-3.5-turbo-0301", "timestamp": "2023-04-10 01:05:46+00:00", "conversation": [{"content": "python读取Excel第5张表第11列所有不为空的字符串并逐个添加到数组，统计数组中各个元素的数量，画出饼状图，饼状图内表明数量、括号内的占比，饼状图保存到word文件中，代码中不含中文状态字符。", "country": "China", "hashed_ip": "6f3fd08cac1ade6121bf5f4aad271e9a18e0c186f7fc14f24b61205acde4f161", "header": {"accept-language": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9", "user-agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/107.0.0.0 Safari/537.36"}, "language": "Chinese", "redacted": false, "role": "user", "state": "Beijing", "timestamp": null, "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 104451}, {"content": "```python\nimport openpyxl\nfrom collections import Counter\nfrom matplotlib import pyplot as plt\nimport numpy as np\nimport os\n\n# 读取Excel文件\nwb = openpyxl.load_workbook('example.xlsx')\nsheet = wb.worksheets[4] # 第5张表\ncol = sheet['K'] # 第11列\ndata = []\nfor cell in col:\n    if isinstance(cell.value,str): # 判断是否为字符串\n        data.append(cell.value)\n\n# 统计各个元素的数量\ncount = Counter(data)\nlabels = list(count.keys())\nsizes = list(count.values())\n\n# 绘制饼状图\nplt.figure(figsize=(6,6),dpi=80)\nplt.axes(aspect=1)\nplt.pie(sizes, labels=labels, autopct='%1.1f%%', shadow=False, startangle=90)\nplt.title('Pie Chart')\n\n# 保存饼状图到图片文件\nfilename = 'chart.png'\nplt.savefig(filename)\n\n# 将图片插入Word文件\nfrom docx import Document\nfrom docx.shared import Inches\n\ndocument = Document()\nparagraph = document.add_paragraph()\npicture = paragraph.add_run().add_picture(filename,width=Inches(6))\nos.remove(filename) # 删除图片文件\ndocument.save('example.docx')\n```", "country": null, "hashed_ip": null, "header": null, "language": "English", "redacted": false, "role": "assistant", "state": null, "timestamp": "2023-04-09 10:28:25+00:00", "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 104451}, {"content": "上面代码保存的图片一片空白", "country": "China", "hashed_ip": "6f3fd08cac1ade6121bf5f4aad271e9a18e0c186f7fc14f24b61205acde4f161", "header": {"accept-language": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9", "user-agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/107.0.0.0 Safari/537.36"}, "language": "Chinese", "redacted": false, "role": "user", "state": "Beijing", "timestamp": null, "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 104518}, {"content": "问题可能出在绘制饼状图时没有关闭图形界面，导致图片没有输出。可以尝试在绘制完成后加上 `plt.close()` 关闭图形界面，然后再保存图片。代码修改如下：\n```python\nimport openpyxl\nfrom collections import Counter\nfrom matplotlib import pyplot as plt\nimport numpy as np\nimport os\n\n# 读取Excel文件\nwb = openpyxl.load_workbook('example.xlsx')\nsheet = wb.worksheets[4] # 第5张表\ncol = sheet['K'] # 第11列\ndata = []\nfor cell in col:\n    if isinstance(cell.value,str): # 判断是否为字符串\n        data.append(cell.value)\n\n# 统计各个元素的数量\ncount = Counter(data)\nlabels = list(count.keys())\nsizes = list(count.values())\n\n# 绘制饼状图\nplt.figure(figsize=(6,6),dpi=80)\nplt.axes(aspect=1)\nplt.pie(sizes, labels=labels, autopct='%1.1f%%', shadow=False, startangle=90)\nplt.title('Pie Chart')\nplt.close() # 关闭图形界面\n\n# 保存饼状图到图片文件\nfilename = 'chart.png'\nplt.savefig(filename)\n\n# 将图片插入Word文件\nfrom docx import Document\nfrom docx.shared import Inches\n\ndocument = Document()\nparagraph = document.add_paragraph()\npicture = paragraph.add_run().add_picture(filename,width=Inches(6))\nos.remove(filename) # 删除图片文件\ndocument.save('example.docx')\n```", "country": null, "hashed_ip": null, "header": null, "language": "English", "redacted": false, "role": "assistant", "state": null, "timestamp": "2023-04-09 10:40:04+00:00", "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 104518}, {"content": "还是空白", "country": "China", "hashed_ip": "6f3fd08cac1ade6121bf5f4aad271e9a18e0c186f7fc14f24b61205acde4f161", "header": {"accept-language": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9", "user-agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/107.0.0.0 Safari/537.36"}, "language": "Chinese", "redacted": false, "role": "user", "state": "Beijing", "timestam