{"conversation_hash": "7133f864fa59594abb1da306ce7ada22", "model": "gpt-4-0314", "timestamp": "2023-04-10 01:16:04+00:00", "conversation": [{"content": "900 کاراکتر محتوا در مورد عطر اونتوس", "country": "Iran", "hashed_ip": "b44deb7d26047fa8e4639ca923fa758a4ff668dd6f5bd28d02778522b2901b88", "header": {"accept-language": "en-US,en;q=0.9,ur;q=0.8,fa;q=0.7", "user-agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/111.0.0.0 Safari/537.36"}, "language": "Persian", "redacted": false, "role": "user", "state": "Tehran", "timestamp": null, "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 108678}, {"content": "عطر اونتوس کرید (Aventus Creed) یکی از پرفروش‌ترین و محبوب‌ترین عطرهای لوکس و اکستریم جهان است که در سال 2010 به دست خانواده کرید به بازار عطر و ادکلن عرضه شد. این عطر نماد قدرت، موفقیت و شکوه است که با الهام از زندگی ناپلئون بوناپارت، امپراتور ناپلیونی فرانسه طراحی شده است. \n\nاین عطر یک ترکیب منحصر به‌فرد از نت‌های میوه‌ای، چوبی، مرکبات و اسطوخودوس ایجاد می‌کند که سرگرم‌کننده و همزمان اعتماد بخش برای کسانی است که به دنبال استایل و هویت منحصر به‌فرد می‌گردند. عطر اونتوس دارای شروع میوه‌ای بی‌نظیری است که با رایحه انبه قوی و طالبی معطر می‌شود و به زودی با نت‌هایی گرم و جدی از چوبیانه و وانیل ملایمت را در رایحه ایجاد می‌کند. ترکیبی که در نهایت به تجلی دل‌برگیری از عود و جاویدان می‌رسد.\n\nدر رایحه اُونتوس، گلابی، برگ بنفشه و فلفل نیروی بی‌نظیری به این کامپوزیسیون می‌دهند. نت‌های میانی شامل یاس، پرتقال ماندارین و برگ بو می‌باشد که گرما و لذت اضافی به این عطر افسانه‌ای می‌بخشند. همچنین در پایه عطر، آکوردهایی از چوب صنوبر هندی، چوب سرو کوهی، چوب سدر و عنبر نرم همراه با وانیل و مشک سفید ثبات و عمق فوق‌العاده‌ای به اونتوس کرید می‌دهند.\n\nAventus Creed، با بطنی ولع گیرای تمدن خود شکوه دولتمندی ویژه را به اهل بزرگی و شریک خویش می‌دهد، و کسانی را که آن را انتخاب می کنند به یاد ماندنی می سازد. این عطر، گزینه ایده‌آلی برای مردان جوان و پویا است که به دنبال ایجاد تاثیر ماندگار و جاودان در ذهن اطرافیان هستند. بطنی زنده، خوک جهان به زیبایی حضور عطرنشین می نماید که به نظم وتهذیب کامل اهدای می‌شود.", "country": null, "hashed_ip": null, "header": null, "language": "Persian", "redacted": false, "role": "assistant", "state": null, "timestamp": "2023-04-10 00:29:28+00:00", "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 108678}, {"content": "creed aventus perfume 500 charachters", "country": "Iran", "hashed_ip": "b44deb7d26047fa8e4639ca923fa758a4ff668dd6f5bd28d02778522b2901b88", "header": {"accept-language": "en-US,en;q=0.9,ur;q=0.8,fa;q=0.7", "user-agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/111.0.0.0 Safari/537.36"}, "language": "Latin", "redacted": false, "role": "user", "state": "Tehran", "timestamp": null, "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 108797}, {"content": "Creed Aventus perfume is an iconic, luxurious fragrance, launched in 2010 by the renowned Creed family. It symbolizes power, success, and magnificence, and is inspired by the life of Napoleon Bonaparte, the famous French Emperor. Aventus boasts a unique combination of fruity, woody, citrus, and floral notes designed to amaze and instill confidence in those who wear it.\n\nThe fragrance starts with a bold pineapple scent, followed by warm and sophisticated woody and vanilla notes. Its heart is filled with rose, violet leaves, and spicy pepper, giving it unparalleled strength. The refreshing middle notes include jasmine, mandarin orange, and birch leaves that add warmth and pleasure to this legendary perfume. The base is a soft blend of Indian sandalwood, mountain cypress, cedar, and amber, offering depth and incredible longevity.\n\nAventus Creed is the perfect choice for young, bold men who seek to create a lasting and unforgettable impression in the minds of those around them. Its sophisticated and captivating scent commands respect and admiration, making the wearer truly unforgettable.", "country": null, "hashed_ip": null, "header": null, "language": "English", "redacted": false, "role": "assistant", "state": null, "timestamp": "2023-04-10 01:05:14+00:00", "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 108797}, {"content": "creed aventus perfume 3000 charachters", "country": "Iran", "hashed_ip": "b44deb7d26047fa8e4639ca923fa758a4ff668dd6f5bd28d02778522b2901b88", "header": {"accept-language": "en-US,en;q=0.9,ur;q=0.8,fa;q=0.7", "user-agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/111.0.0.0 Safari/537.36"}, "language": "Latin", "redacted": false, "role": "user", "state": "Tehran", "timestamp": null, "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 108858}, {"content": "Creed Aventus perfume is an iconic, luxurious fragrance that has become a staple in the world of scent since it was launched in 2010 by the renowned Creed family. Aventus symbolizes power, success, and magnificence and is inspired by the life of Napoleon Bonaparte, the famous French Emperor known for his ambitious conquests and grand sense of style. Created by Olivier Creed, the master perfumer of the Creed house, Aventus is a unique combination of fruity, woody, citrus, floral notes with a touch of smokiness that sets it apart from conventional fragrances.\n\nThe opening of Aventus is defined by a bold and captivating scent of pineapple that quickly takes center-stage, accompanied by other fruity notes such as blackcurrant and apple. These sweet and tangy notes create a seductive allure that makes a memorable first impression. Soon after, the fragrance transitions to showcase warm, sophisticated, and woody notes, with the presence of birch contributing a smoked and masculine character to the composition. The addition of vanilla brings a touch of smoothness and sensuality to the blend.\n\nThe heart of Creed Aventus perfume is an ode to strength and romance, with a delicate balance of floral and spicy elements. Rose and jasmine add a sense of refinement and opulence, while the violet leaves and pink pepper bring a touch of intrigue and excitement to the mix. This bouquet of flowers and spices is further enriched by the zesty, fresh aroma of mandarin orange and the green, earthy tones of birch leaves, which complement and uplift the overall character of the scent.\n\nThe base of Creed Aventus is an exquisite blend of woods, resins, and musks, providing the fragrance with depth, complexity, and incredible longevity. The presence of Indian sandalwood, mountain cypress, and cedar imparts a sense of serenity and warmth that lingers on the skin for hours. The soft, comforting scent of amber and the luxurious creaminess of vanilla create an enveloping, lingering aroma, while white musk adds a layer of sensuality and subtle masculinity to the perfume's foundation.\n\nAventus Creed is a premium, high-quality fragrance that, thanks to its unique combination of notes, has become a universal favorite among men of all ages, cultures, and backgrounds. Its powerful yet sophisticated scent creates an air of confidence, making it the perfect choice for those looking to make a lasting and unforgettable impression. Moreover, its versatility allows it to transition seamlessly from day to night, and its striking composition suits a variety of occasions, whether it be a professional meeting, a romantic rendezvous, or a black-tie event.\n\nAventus Creed stands as a testament to the craftsmanship and artistry that goes into each of the brand's creations, earning its place as a modern classic in the world of fine perfumery. With each spray, the wearer reclaims Napoleon's sense of ambition and grandeur, transforming their personal style and leaving a mark on everyone they encounter. Aventus is truly the crowning jewel in the Creed perfume collection, an unforgettable fragrance that continues to impress and intoxicate those who experience its captivating allure.", "country": null, "hashed_ip": null, "header": null, "language": "English", "redacted": false, "role": "assistant", "state": null, "timestamp": "2023-04-10 01:16:04+00:00", "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 108858}