铁站与输入地址之间的距离\nsubway_df['distance_to_input'] = subway_df.apply(lambda row: \n    geopy.distance.distance(input_coords, (row['latitude'], row['longitude'])).km, axis=1)\n\n# 4. 找到距离最近的地铁站，并输出距离\nclosest_station = subway_df.loc[subway_df['distance_to_input'].idxmin()]\nprint(\"The closest subway station is\", closest_station['name'], \"which is\", round(closest_station['distance_to_input'], 2), \"km away.\")\n```\n\n这是一个粗略的示例，实际情况可能需要进行更多处理，以适合您的具体应用场景。", "country": null, "hashed_ip": null, "header": null, "language": "Chinese", "redacted": false, "role": "assistant", "state": null, "timestamp": "2023-04-10 01:14:53+00:00", "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 108846}, {"content": "上海各地铁站的经纬度", "country": "China", "hashed_ip": "8305ec4888c4c8f5f828609d69045209cd4aa7b1ef778696a04d81a78d260808", "header": {"accept-language": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9", "user-agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/110.0.0.0 Safari/537.36"}, "language": "Chinese", "redacted": false, "role": "user", "state": "Shanghai", "timestamp": null, "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 108866}, {"content": "以下是上海各地铁站的经纬度数据，仅供参考：\n\n| 站名     | 经度       | 纬度       |\n|----------|------------|------------|\n| 莘庄     | 121.38597  | 31.116681  |\n| 外环路   | 121.39396  | 31.122076  |\n| 莲花路   | 121.406663 | 31.130552  |\n| 锦江乐园 | 121.41694  | 31.142181  |\n| 上海南站 | 121.433143 | 31.154579  |\n| 漕宝路   | 121.445384 | 31.168315  |\n| 上海体育场 | 121.450471 | 31.182856 |\n| 徐家汇   | 121.436129 | 31.199088  |\n| 殷高西路 | 121.509065 | 31.276903  |\n| 北新泾   | 121.360523 | 31.216919  |\n| 娄山关路 | 121.411994 | 31.223464  |\n| 中山公园 | 121.4222   | 31.22325   |\n| 金沙江路 | 121.3532   | 31.24064   |\n| 曹杨路   | 121.430041 | 31.238779  |\n| 长寿路   | 121.436645 | 31.246174  |\n| 长江南路 | 121.500852 | 31.180674  |\n| 成山路   | 121.525428 | 31.166906  |\n| 东方体育中心 | 121.505969 | 31.155848 |\n| 陆家浜路 | 121.4967   | 31.215817  |\n| 大渡河路 | 121.394568 | 31.279797  |\n| 宝山路   | 121.483307 | 31.259374  |\