{"conversation_hash": "9d3485555f0be6e5dff875f32df21d7c", "model": "gpt-4-0314", "timestamp": "2023-04-10 01:30:25+00:00", "conversation": [{"content": "C++解析ps国标流（h264,aac），不用ffmpeg库", "country": "China", "hashed_ip": "eaaac42a460adf528b99fe5922615e18e47c41bcadbf6dc4aad454da3a447ada", "header": {"accept-language": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9,en-US;q=0.8,en;q=0.7", "user-agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 12; JAD-AL80 Build/HUAWEIJAD-AL80; wv) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Version/4.0 Chrome/107.0.5304.141 Mobile Safari/537.36 XWEB/5023 MMWEBSDK/20230303 MMWEBID/3311 MicroMessenger/8.0.34.2340(0x28002253) WeChat/arm64 Weixin NetType/4G Language/zh_CN ABI/arm64"}, "language": "Chinese", "redacted": false, "role": "user", "state": "Guangdong", "timestamp": null, "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 108988}, {"content": "解析H.264流和AAC流是一个相对复杂的过程，特别是在不使用ffmpeg库的情况下。然而，你可以选择使用其他开源库或者通过手动解析流中的NALU单元（H264）或ADTS帧（AAC）来实现。\n\n对于H.264流，你可以使用开源库 x264（https://www.videolan.org/developers/x264.html）或OpenH264（https://github.com/cisco/openh264）。这些库提供了一系列用于解析H.264流的API。以下是使用x264库解析H.264流的简单示例：\n\n```cpp\n#include <x264.h>\n#include <stdint.h>\n#include <stdio.h>\n\nvoid parse_h264_stream(const uint8_t *buffer, int length) {\n    x264_nal_t *nal = NULL;\n    int i_nal = 0;\n\n    int result = x264_nal_decode(&nal, &i_nal, (uint8_t *)buffer, length);\n    if (result < 0) {\n        printf(\"Error decoding H.264 stream\\n\");\n        return;\n    }\n\n    for (int i = 0; i < i_nal; i++) {\n        x264_nal_t *current_nal = &nal[i];\n        printf(\"NAL unit type: %d\\n\", current_nal->i_type);\n    }\n\n    x264_nal_release(nal);\n}\n```\n\n对于AAC流，FAAD2（http://www.audiocoding.com/downloads.html）是一个用于解析AAC音频流的库。以下是使用FAAD库解析AAC流的简单示例：\n\n```cpp\n#include <neaacdec.h>\n#include <stdint.h>\n#include <stdio.h>\n\nvoid parse_aac_stream(const uint8_t *buffer, int length) {\n    NeAACDecHandle handle = NeAACDecOpen();\n\n    NeAACDecConfigurationPtr conf = NeAACDecGetCurrentConfiguration(handle);\n    conf->outputFormat = FAAD_FMT_16BIT; // output format, left as default\n    NeAACDecSetConfiguration(handle, conf);\n\n    long unsigned int sample_rate;\n    unsigned char channels;\n    int result = NeAACDecInit(handle, (uint8_t *)buffer, length, &sample_rate, &channels);\n    if (result < 0) {\n        printf(\"Error initializing AAC decoder\\n\");\n        NeAACDecClose(handle);\n        return;\n    }\n\n    NeAACDecFrameInfo frame_info;\n    void *sample_buffer = NeAACDecDecode(handle, &frame_info, (uint8_t *)buffer, length);\n\n    if (frame_info.error > 0) {\n        printf(\"Error decoding frame: %s\\n\", NeAACDecGetErrorMessage(frame_info.error));\n    } else {\n        printf(\"AAC frame decoded successfully\\n\");\n    }\n\n    NeAACDecClose(handle);\n}\n```\n\n请注意，这些示例假定你已经从输入流或文件中读取了原始的H.264或AAC数据。要手动解析这些格式，你需要了解H.264和AAC的详细规范，比如ISO/IEC 14496-10（H.264）和ISO/IEC 14496-3（AAC）。", "country": null, "hashed_ip": null, "header": null, "language": "English", "redacted": false, "role": "assistant", "state": null, "timestamp": "2023-04-10 01:30:25+00:00", "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 108988}], "turn": 1, "language": "Chinese", "openai_moderation": [{"categories": {"harassment": false, "harassment/threatening": false, "harassment_threatening": false, "hate": false, "hate/threatening": false, "hate_threatening": false, "self-harm": false, "self-harm/instructions": false, "self-harm/intent": false, "self_harm": false, "self_harm_instructions": false, "self_harm_intent": false, "sexual": false, "sexual/minors": false, "sexual_minors": false, "violence": false, "violence/graphic": false, "violence_graphic": false}, "category_scores": {"harassment": 0.00023262605827767402, "harassment/threatening": 4.4626676753978245e-06, "harassment_threatening": 4.4626676753978245e-06, "hate": 0.00014374111196957529, "hate/threatening": 5.327619945205697e-08, "hate_threatening": 5.327619945205697e-08, "self-harm": 1.450432165484017e-07, "self-harm/instructions": 3.010775