{"conversation_hash": "d3759f40d34345214682c958c61a537f", "model": "gpt-3.5-turbo-0301", "timestamp": "2023-04-10 01:38:21+00:00", "conversation": [{"content": "What is meant by the term oxidant?\nWhat is meant by the term oxidant?\nIt is the reactant that's being reduced.\nIt is oxygen in any oxidation reactions.\nIt is the reactant that's being oxidized.\nIt is the reactant that's being combined with  O\n .\n", "country": "United States", "hashed_ip": "788993c3b20d7ae0082f8b6d21912391cdff828c5c0da0a3665a98b949286072", "header": {"accept-language": "en-US,en;q=0.9", "user-agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/111.0.0.0 Safari/537.36"}, "language": "English", "redacted": false, "role": "user", "state": "Arizona", "timestamp": null, "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 108851}, {"content": "It is the reactant that causes another reactant to lose electrons, thereby undergoing oxidation.", "country": null, "hashed_ip": null, "header": null, "language": "English", "redacted": false, "role": "assistant", "state": null, "timestamp": "2023-04-10 01:15:22+00:00", "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 108851}, {"content": "What is meant by the term Oxidant? 1. It is the reactant that's being reduced 2. It is oxygen in any oxidation reactions 3. It is the reactant that's being oxidized 4. It is the reactant that's being combined with O.", "country": "United States", "hashed_ip": "788993c3b20d7ae0082f8b6d21912391cdff828c5c0da0a3665a98b949286072", "header": {"accept-language": "en-US,en;q=0.9", "user-agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/111.0.0.0 Safari/537.36"}, "language": "English", "redacted": false, "role": "user", "state": "Arizona", "timestamp": null, "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 108860}, {"content": "Option 3. It is the reactant that's being oxidized.", "country": null, "hashed_ip": null, "header": null, "language": "English", "redacted": false, "role"