{"conversation_hash": "bc4f19c4b6e5dfc67c583ed4f39a659e", "model": "gpt-4-0314", "timestamp": "2023-04-10 02:02:13+00:00", "conversation": [{"content": "REPRESENTANT (ID_rep, nomR, ville)\nPRODUIT (ID_prod, nomP, couleur, enStock)\nCLIENT (ID_client, nomC, ville)\nVENTE (ID_rep, ID_prod, ID_client, quantite)\nFK (ID_rep) REFERENCES REPRESENTANT(ID_rep),\nFK (ID_prod) REFERENCES PRODUIT(ID_prod),\nFK (ID_client) REFERENCES CLIENT(ID_client)\n\n Ecrivez la requête SQL correspondant à la question suivante : Quels sont les numéros des\nclients (ID_client) qui n'ont rien acheté à un représentant de Montréal ? Les clients qui n’ont acheté\naucun produit à aucun représentant ne doivent pas se retrouver dans le résultat.", "country": "France", "hashed_ip": "aa76e72185c0c6f600db601a229dc5234e7622f1d227a07ec2cd1352dc651942", "header": {"accept-language": "es-ES,es;q=0.9,en-US;q=0.8,en;q=0.7,fr-FR;q=0.6,fr;q=0.5", "user-agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/111.0.0.0 Safari/537.36"}, "language": "French", "redacted": false, "role": "user", "state": "Upper Savoy", "timestamp": null, "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 109153}, {"content": "SELECT DISTINCT ID_client\nFROM CLIENT\nWHERE ID_client NOT IN (\n    SELECT VENTE.ID_client\n    FROM VENTE\n    INNER JOIN REPRESENTANT ON VENTE.ID_rep = REPRESENTANT.ID_rep\n    WHERE REPRESENTANT.ville = 'Montréal'\n)\nAND ID_client IN (\n    SELECT VENTE.ID_client\n    FROM VENTE\n);", "country": null, "hashed_ip": null, "header": null, "language": "English", "redacted": false, "role": "assistant", "state": null, "timestamp": "2023-04-10 01:51:39+00:00", "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 109153}, {"content": "SELECT DISTINCT ID_client FROM Client \nWHERE ID_client NOT IN (SELECT V.ID_Client FROM Vente v, Representant r \nWHERE v.id_rep = r.id_rep AND r.ville = 'Montreal') \nAND ID_client IN (\nSELECT VENTE.ID_client\nFROM VENTE\n);\n\nCette requête est-t-elle correcte comme répon